  message: "P3 REVIEW 2026-11-01 (dev 100b6fbb6e; owner-requested re-check of open P3 items last modified before 2026-10-20; fixtures under ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/p3_review_11012026/langs2/). VERDICT: PARTLY-STALE. 2026-11-01 review at dev 100b6fbb6e: Kotlin X : Outer.Inner() -> base_classes ['Outer'] and an extends edge X -> in-repo Outer; S : java.io.Serializable -> 'java'; Ad : RecyclerView.Adapter<VH>() -> 'RecyclerView'; Swift Y: Outer2.Inner2 -> 'Outer2', Z: Foundation.NSObject -> extends external Foundation. The PHP half is fixed: class U extends \\Foo\\Bar -> extends in-repo Bar, W extends \\Ext\\Thing -> external Thing (inheritance.py now splits on backslash, 62ac07d6a3 WI-pivap). MECHANISM: Kotlin/Swift base extraction keeps the first user_type segment instead of the leaf (kotlin _extract_user_type_name, swift _extract_base_classes_swift). SHARES MECHANISM WITH: WI-joror INV-tohuj."  # 503d
